    "summary_one_sentence": "When a sudden horrific outbreak turns his routine delivery into a nightmare, medical courier Bryan must fight through the chaos to survive.",
    "summary_short": "Bryan is an ordinary medical courier whose life is upended during a routine package delivery when an unexpected biohazardous outbreak turns the city into a deadly battleground. Trapped in the escalating chaos, he is forced to rely on his instincts to navigate the dangerous streets. Along the way, Bryan encounters terrifying horrors and desperate survivors as he searches for a way to safety. To endure the crisis, he must adapt quickly to a world collapsing rapidly around him.",
    "summary_long": "Bryan works as a dedicated medical courier, spending his days navigating city traffic to deliver critical medical supplies. During what begins as an ordinary shift, reports of sudden, violent incidents begin flooding the news and surrounding streets. Before he can complete his route, a full-scale biohazardous outbreak erupts, transforming the population into hostile threats and plunging the city into complete hysteria. Realizing that normal life has instantly vanished, Bryan shifts into survival mode, taking refuge in abandoned structures while dodging horrific monsters and dangerous hazards. As he navigates the urban wasteland, he uncovers frightening clues about the nature of the outbreak and the entity responsible for the catastrophe. Forced to make split-second decisions, Bryan forms brief, uneasy alliances with other stranded civilians attempting to flee the containment zone. Together, they brave ruthless dangers, scarce resources, and constant threats lurking around every corner. Facing insurmountable odds, Bryan must use whatever tools are at his disposal to stay alive through the terrifying ordeal. Ultimately, his journey becomes a harrowing struggle of human resilience against an overwhelming science-fiction horror.",
